---
/**
 * @category FAQ
 * @theme classic
 * @name FAQ
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-16 py-16'>
  <div class='w-full'>
    <h2
      class='text-5xl text-center text-stone-800 font-semibold tracking-[-2%] px-4'
    >
      Frequently Asked Questions
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div class='w-full px-4 mt-10'>
    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'
          >How do I get started with this Astro site builder?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          To get started, simply install the project using the terminal. Once
          installed, you can run it locally and start building your Astro site
          by dragging and dropping prewritten components.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'>How do I customize my Astro site?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          You can easily customize your Astro site by changing the text and
          images inside the prewritten components. For more advanced
          customization, you can also modify the code directly if needed. This
          flexibility allows you to personalize your site to your exact
          specifications.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'>How do I deploy my Astro site?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          Once you've built your site, you can export the project to get all the
          code. Then, you can easily deploy your Astro site using popular
          platforms like Vercel or Netlify.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'
          >What are the licensing terms for this Astro site builder?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          This Astro site builder is free for personal use. However, for
          commercial use, a license must be purchased. Please refer to our
          licensing page for more details on commercial usage and pricing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
